Now I am also looking for a shirt for the summer.
The shirt should have short sleeves.
I see a yellow shirt on a table.
The colour is very cheerful.
It is perfect for everyday wear.
I take the shirt in my normal size.
I want to try the shirt on, of course.
I look towards the fitting rooms.
There are a lot of people standing there.
Then I look towards the till.
The queue for the fitting rooms is much longer than the queue at the till.
I don't want to wait that long today.
I think my normal size will definitely fit.
Therefore, I do not try the shirt on.
I take the shirt and the jacket.
I go directly to the till.
